msgid "Withdrawal Button: there is no public withdrawal page."
msgstr "Withdrawal Button: no hi ha cap pàgina pública de desistiment."

msgid "Customers who bought without an account need a page where they can withdraw at any time during the withdrawal period (Art. 11a(1) of Directive 2011/83/EU)."
msgstr "Els clients que van comprar sense compte necessiten una pàgina on puguin desistir en qualsevol moment del termini (art. 11 bis.1 de la Directiva 2011/83/UE)."

msgid "Create the withdrawal page"
msgstr "Crea la pàgina de desistiment"

msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "No tens permís per fer això."

msgid "Is Withdrawal Button helping your store? A short review on WordPress.org helps other merchants find it."
msgstr "T’ajuda Withdrawal Button? Una ressenya breu a WordPress.org ajuda altres botigues a trobar-lo."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Deixa una ressenya a WordPress.org"

msgid "Rate"
msgstr "Valora"

msgid "Upgrade to Pro"
msgstr "Passa a Pro"

msgid "Withdrawal Button Pro"
msgstr "Withdrawal Button Pro"

msgid "PDF acknowledgement attached to the customer email, SHA-256 hash of each request, email log with exact timestamps, anti-fraud alerts and order status sync."
msgstr "Justificant de recepció en PDF adjunt al correu del client, hash SHA-256 de cada sol·licitud, registre de correus amb l’hora exacta, alertes antifrau i sincronització amb l’estat de la comanda."

msgid "Get Pro — €39 one-time payment"
msgstr "Obtén Pro — pagament únic de 39 €"

