msgstr "Termini de desistiment (dies)"

msgid "Legal minimum is 14 calendar days. You can offer more."
msgstr "El mínim legal són 14 dies naturals. En pots oferir més."

msgid "Grace days (optional)"
msgstr "Dies de cortesia (opcional)"

